            },
            {
                "date": "2017-02-09",
                "text": "If you control two Winding Constrictors, the number of counters placed on the artifact or creature is the original number plus two. Three Winding Constrictors adds three to the original number, and so on."
            },
            {
                "date": "2017-02-09",
